WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Baddel fixes text typed with the wrong keyboard layout. (Illustrated demo.)

2
00:02.000 --> 00:06.000
You meant to write Arabic, but the keyboard was on English: "hgsghl ugd;l".

3
00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
Press the shortcut once: Baddel fixes the last word, or the selected text, and switches the keyboard to Arabic.

4
00:10.000 --> 00:13.500
Click Undo to restore the original text and the previous keyboard layout.

5
00:13.500 --> 00:19.000
Press the shortcut twice quickly: Baddel fixes the whole field and switches the keyboard to Arabic.

6
00:19.000 --> 00:23.000
Shortcut: Option-Shift-Space on macOS, Control-Alt-Space on Windows and Linux. Download: mahmoood.com/baddel
